        "anti_duplication_notes": "Protect the shared inhale grammar. It must not flatten into White Wash, fragment into Shimmer, travel as Chase bars, or become Temple's candle vigil.",
        "review_state": "TUNE",
        "evidence_notes": "Control names, declaration order, defaults, and source AUDIO_MODULATION_V1 handles are byte-for-value preserved; white_only saves an explicit unmodulated operator-review tune for every control. The old capture read as nearly uniform, so the rework adds cross-roll negative space, breathing ribs and voids, sequential Jewelry pearls, staggered Organ punctuation, and moving Identity diagonals while retaining one shared body breath. Cross-model truth reports zero WRONG, WEAK, or DEAD controls; exact saved-value silence/audio gates cover Titanic and test_bench. The gallery manifest fingerprints the exact source, goal registry, playlist, saved/effective values, duration, frame rate, and media shown on this row."
